{'symbol': 'DGX', 'date': '2022-04-20 16:10:00', 'title': 'QUEST DIAGNOSTICS ANNOUNCES ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGES TO ACCELERATE GROWTH AND DRIVE OPERATIONAL EXCELLENCE', 'text': "SECAUCUS, N.J. , APRIL 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUEST DIAGNOSTICS \xa0(NYSE: DGX), THE WORLD'S LEADING PROVIDER OF DIAGNOSTIC INFORMATION SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS MADE SEVERAL ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGES AND LEADERSHIP APPOINTMENTS OF SEASONED EXECUTIVES\xa0TO BETTER SUPPORT THE COMPANY'S TWO-POINT BUSINESS STRATEGY TO ACCELERATE GROWTH AND DRIVE OPERATIONAL EXCELLENCE: CATHERINE T."}